    "unscoped-ground-support": "Do not imply that ground support is included before a written scope and custom quote are confirmed.",
    "hotel-real-time-availability": "Do not claim real-time hotel or room availability.",
    "hotel-guest-acceptance-guarantee": "Do not guarantee that a property will accept a foreign guest.",
    "hotel-price-room-guarantee": "Do not guarantee a hotel price, room type, accessibility feature or property condition.",
    "vehicle-driver-availability-guarantee": "Do not guarantee a vehicle, driver or transfer slot.",
    "fixed-transfer-price-or-pickup-guarantee": "Do not promise a fixed transfer price, pickup point or pickup time without confirmation.",
