    "ticket-availability-price-guarantee": "Do not claim live ticket inventory or a guaranteed ticket price.",
    "booking-entry-guarantee": "Do not promise successful booking or entry.",
    "reseller-official-equivalence": "Do not describe a reseller as equivalent to an official issuer or channel.",
    "sensitive-data-first-contact": "Do not request passport images, payment data or unredacted booking references in the first contact."
